<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Shorsajè - Artisan Crochet Boutique</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;700&family=Lato:wght@300;400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f5f5f0; /* Cream */
            color: #5a4a42; /* Terracotta */
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        header {
            background-color: #a8b5a0; /* Sage green */
            padding: 1rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        nav ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 2rem;
        }
        nav a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #f5f5f0;
            font-weight: 400;
        }
        .hero {
            background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556742049-0cfed4f6a45d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1950&q=80'); /* Placeholder: Model in crochet jacket */
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            height: 80vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            color: #f5f5f0;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin: 1rem 0;
        }
        section {
            padding: 4rem 2rem;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .shop-categories {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }
        .category {
            background-color: #f5f5f0;
            padding: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .category img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .the-craft {
            background-color: #d4c5b9; /* Light terracotta */
            color: #5a4a42;
        }
        .gallery {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
        }
        .gallery img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .about-us {
            background-color: #a8b5a0;
            color: #f5f5f0;
        }
        footer {
            background-color: #5a4a42;
            color: #f5f5f0;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1rem;
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
            .shop-categories { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h2>Shorsajè</h2>
        <nav>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#hero">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="#shop">Shop</a></li>
                <li><a href="#craft">The Craft</a></li>
                <li><a href="#gallery">Gallery</a></li>
                <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section id="hero" class="hero">
        <div>
            <h1>Artisan Stitches, Timeless Style</h1>
            <p>Discover handmade crochet pieces crafted with soul and sustainability.</p>
            <a href="#shop" style="background-color: #a8b5a0; color: #f5f5f0; padding: 1rem 2rem; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px;">Shop Now</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="shop" class="shop-categories">
        <div class="category">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1591047139829-d91aecb6caea?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1934&q=80" alt="Intricate Crochet Jacket">
            <h3>Intricate Jackets</h3>
            <p>Oversized, textured jackets for everyday elegance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="category">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1553062407-98eeb64c6a62?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1950&q=80" alt="Statement Crochet Bag">
            <h3>Statement Bags</h3>
            <p>Handcrafted totes and handbags with unique details.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="category">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1601762603332-fd61e28b698a?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1950&q=80" alt="Seasonal Crochet Accessories">
            <h3>Seasonal Accessories</h3>
            <p>Scarves, hats, and more for every season.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="craft" class="the-craft">
        <h2>The Craft</h2>
        <p>At Shorsajè, we embrace slow fashion. Each piece is meticulously handcrafted by local artisans using sustainable, high-quality yarns. From selecting the perfect fibers to the final stitch, our process honors the time and care that goes into creating something truly timeless. No mass production—just pure, tactile artistry.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="gallery">
        <h2>Gallery</h2>
        <div class="gallery">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578662996442-48f60103fc96?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1950&q=80" alt="Crochet Texture Close-Up">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1607345366640-4b4d3c6d4505?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1950&q=80" alt="Yarn Details">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556742049-0cfed4f6a45d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1950&q=80" alt="Model in Jacket">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1591047139829-d91aecb6caea?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1934&q=80" alt="Bag Texture">
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about" class="about-us">
        <h2>About Us</h2>
        <p>Shorsajè was born from a passion for the tactile beauty of crochet and a commitment to sustainable, local craftsmanship. Founded by [Your Name or Artisan's Name], a skilled artisan in [Your Location], our brand celebrates the stories woven into every stitch. We source yarns from ethical suppliers and create pieces that tell a tale of heritage, creativity, and connection. Join us in embracing slow fashion—one handmade treasure at a time.</p>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2023 Shorsajè. All rights reserved. | Follow us on Instagram @shorsaje</p>
    </footer>

    <script>
        // Simple gallery slider (optional interactivity)
        const gallery = document.querySelector('.gallery');
        let index = 0;
        setInterval(() => {
            index = (index + 1) % gallery.children.length;
            gallery.scrollLeft = gallery.children[index].offsetLeft;
        }, 3000);
    </script>
</body>
</html>
